  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill. It has front matter and is matched by the `skills` site query, so the requirement applies.\n\n- **Workflow comes first.** The first `##` section under `# Habeas` is `## Workflow`. It comes before `## Testing and coverage artifacts`, `## Inspecting`, `## Requirements, examples, and definitions`, `## References` and `## Gotchas`.\n- **The steps are ordered.** The workflow is a numbered checklist: `- [ ] 1. Pick the skill for the task:` and `- [ ] 2. Follow that skill; ...`. Step 1 holds the task-to-skill table and the setup note.\n- **The intro is not a section.** The short paragraph after the `# Habeas` title and before `## Workflow` is a lead-in to the title, not a separate section. Workflow is still the first section.\n\nNo obligation of `requirements.cli.skill_conventions.workflow` is unmet here. The requirement lists no violation queries, so there were none to judge.",
